# any.map — logical service name -> real unit, shared across all inits. Read
# after <init>.map, so a per-init row overrides a row here — the same order
# pkgmap reads <manager>.map before any.map (§1a).
#
# Format:  <logical> = <real unit>
#
# Empty so far: every name that differs does so per init, which is what the
# per-init files are for. A row belongs here only when EVERY init calls the unit
# something other than its logical name.
